# shell: desktop
# home: fixture
# FS-041: dragging a whole volume to the Trash means UNMOUNT -- and the
# boot volume refuses with its name, rather than deleting anything.
wait 12
key w ctrl
wait 3
click 410 35
wait 3
expect-desk-selected-name Boot
key Delete
wait 8
expect-alert cannot unmount the boot volume
key Return
wait 3
note the DRAG says the same: dropping the volume on the Trash asks for an
note unmount and the boot volume refuses again
press 410 35
move 470 35
move 530 35
wait 2
release 530 35
wait 6
expect-alert cannot unmount the boot volume
quit
